The level layouts in js/levels.js are not covered by the MIT license above.
Levels 1-50 are the original Sokoban levels by Thinking Rabbit (Hiroyuki
Imabayashi, 1982-84); levels 51-90 are the classic "Extra" set. They are
included as distributed in the public-domain xsokoban package
(https://github.com/andrewcmyers/xsokoban) and are used here for
non-commercial purposes only.
